# # /EDUcore/
#
# https://w3id.org/EDUcore/ and everything under it redirects to the EDUcore
# resolver, https://educore.dev/edc/
#
# EDUcore publishes permanent identifiers for education data standards: their
# elements, the concepts those elements map to, and versioned sets of mappings.
# The resolver answers each identifier as a document or as JSON.
#
# Identifiers can carry percent-encoded characters that are part of their
# identity (%40 is not @ here), so the rule forwards the path exactly as it was
# requested instead of the decoded path. The query string passes through.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# TQ White II
# tq@ed-core.org
# GitHub username: tqwhite

RewriteEngine on
RewriteCond %{THE_REQUEST} ^[A-Z]+\s/EDUcore/([^\s?]*)
RewriteRule ^ https://educore.dev/edc/%1 [R=303,L,NE]
